  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fbd2c0114102d77c0aab15498ebdd73c, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  enabled: 1
  lines:
  - '* So me and a few other dudes\n  are searching for our friend\n  Snowy.'
  - '* But at this point,^05 it''s become\n  a game of "Who will go missing\n  next?"'
  - '* Huh?^05\n* Why''s that?'
  - '* All of them have gone missing!'
  - '* There''s only a handful of us\n  left now,^05 it seems.'
  - '* Weird...'
  - '* Uhh,^05 I guess we''ll\n  letcha know if we\n  find anything.'
  sounds:
  - snd_text
  - snd_text
  - snd_txtnoe
  - snd_text
  - snd_text
