  remarks: []
  secondaryLines: 0
  lines2:
  - '* So uhh...'
  - '* I think we found\n  what happened with\n  your search squad.'
  - '* Really???'
  - '* Yeah.'
  - '* They all went crazy\n  in that stupid forest\n  detour.'
  - '* ...'
  - '* THAT WAS THEM?????'
  - '* I hope they somehow wake up...'
